AArch64 RT-get+swpl+dmb.st+ctrl+isb
"Expected: Forbidden. Source: derivation only (ARMBar has no ISB): the aarch64.cat clause (ctrl | (addr; po)); [ISB]; po; [R] orders the z load before the get, closing the cycle of RTGet.rt_get_dmbld_forbidden. UNVERIFIED -- run herd7"
{
0:X1=s; 0:X2=x; 0:X3=y; 0:X4=z;
1:X1=s; 1:X4=z;
}
 P0              | P1           ;
 MOV W0,#1       | LDR W0,[X4]  ;
 SWPA W0,W8,[X1] | CBNZ W0,LC00 ;
 DMB ST          | LC00:        ;
 STR W0,[X2]     | ISB          ;
 STR W0,[X3]     | LDR W3,[X1]  ;
 DMB ST          |              ;
 MOV W6,#2       |              ;
 SWPL W6,W9,[X1] |              ;
 DMB ST          |              ;
 STR W0,[X4]     |              ;
exists (0:X8=0 /\ 0:X9=1 /\ 1:X0=1 /\ 1:X3=0)
